Here is another way to rob the shopkeeper, found out myself and is not in the
spoiler file.



SPOILER:
All you need is a pickaxe and a sack (or bag, chest).  Put your pickaxe in
your sack and walk in.  Take it out and dig a trapdoor in the floor.  Return
to the shop and put everything you are not wearing in the sack, accompanied by
the to be stolen goodies.  Wield the sack and fall through your homemade
trapdoor.  The shopkeeper will come after you while you are falling and rob
you of everything you don't wield or wear.

Have a good one, Willem.
